# goal-docs.md §6.6, run-record.md §2 under run-rules/2: amendment documents of this goal and of a sibling goal stay out of the goal document set and the code state, whether written, committed or deleted.
include implement
write $GOAL/amendments/wording.md "# 수정안\n\n## 계기\n\n검토 지적 F1\n"
